{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of the distinct solutions to the equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/9/1c9f2de759d8617f864c7f069f37978b5cb101f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-|2x+1||=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/7/9371afd0fd1f44a5d2d7de9f3e77f9c704b41b99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can create a tree of possibilities, progressively eliminating the absolute value signs by creating different cases.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/a/cfaa7a2656b5dd04faf01404307808955a55054d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(2cm); draw((0,0)--(2,-2)); draw((0,0)--(-2,-2)); label(&quot;$|x-|2x+1||=3$&quot;,(0,0),N); label(&quot;$x-|2x+1|=3$&quot;,(-2,-2),S); label(&quot;$x-|2x+1|=-3$&quot;,(2,-2),S); label(&quot;$|2x+1|=x-3$&quot;,(-2,-2.25),S); label(&quot;$|2x+1|=x+3$&quot;,(2,-2.25),S); draw((2,-2.5)--(3,-3.5)); draw((2,-2.5)--(1,-3.5)); draw((-2,-2.5)--(-3,-3.5)); draw((-2,-2.5)--(-1,-3.5)); label(&quot;$2x+1=x-3$&quot;,(-3,-3.5),S); label(&quot;$x=-2$&quot;,(-3,-3.75),S); label(&quot;$2x+1=-x+3$&quot;,(-1,-3.5),S); label(&quot;$x=\\frac{2}{3}$&quot;,(-1,-3.75),S); label(&quot;$2x+1=x+3$&quot;,(1,-3.5),S); label(&quot;$x=2$&quot;,(1,-3.75),S); label(&quot;$2x+1=-x-3$&quot;,(3,-3.5),S); label(&quot;$x=-\\frac{4}{3}$&quot;,(3,-3.75),S); [/asy]\" width=\"708\" height=\"415\" />\n</p><p>So we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possible solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b2c6442a19db19220692a1993e5b00e4c8f498.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2, \\frac{2}{3}, 2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bec89e8da537dc41b269138b015cc7384efaa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />. Checking for extraneous solutions, we find that the only ones that work are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bec89e8da537dc41b269138b015cc7384efaa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b317654f901a9c8f56585721a617396d3b050c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b